SUMMARY:Christian Girl Talk -Online Zoom Event
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nThis even
 t is for females only\, All ages are welcomed. It will be an online event 
 for Christian Females.\n\nI asked Chat GPT some good Christian Girl Talk q
 uestions and we will be taking turns answering them. We will go through as
  many questions as we can in the limited time.\n\nChat GPT says:\n\n### 
 🌿 Faith & Relationship with God\n\n* When did you feel closest to God r
 ecently?\n* What’s something God has been teaching you this season?\n* I
 s there a Bible verse that’s been on your heart lately?\n* How do you ha
 ndle doubt or spiritual dryness?\n\n### 💛 Identity & Purpose\n\n* Do yo
 u feel called to something specific right now?\n* How do you deal with com
 parison or insecurity?\n\n### 🤍 Friendships & Community\n\n* What does 
 a Godly friendship look like to you?\n* How can we better support each oth
 er in our faith?\n* Have you ever had to set boundaries in a friendship? W
 hat was that like?\n* How do you handle conflict in a Christ-like way?\n\n
 ### 💍 Dating\, Love & Relationships\n\n* What qualities do you value mo
 st in a Godly relationship?\n* How do you guard your heart while dating?\n
 * What does “waiting on God” look like in relationships?\n* How do you
  balance faith and emotions in romantic situations?\n\n### 🌸 Life Strug
 gles & Growth\n\n* How do you respond when prayers feel unanswered?\n* Wha
 t helps you stay grounded during hard times?\n* How has a difficult season
  strengthened your faith?\n\n### 📖 Fun but Meaningful\n\n* Which woman 
 in the Bible do you relate to most and why?\n* If you could ask God one qu
 estion right now\, what would it be?\n* What does your “dream life” lo
 ok like if God is at the center?
