SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nWe are ty
 pically beginner to intermediate levels playing in a friendly\, sociable\,
  and supportive environment while not being shy to a little friendly compe
 tition! We may rally freely in the beginning to warm up and then move on t
 o some quick-rotation matches between 5-7 points. No formal teams here so 
 everyone should be ready to both play with and against everyone else who s
 hows up.\n\nIf you’re going to show up later than 8 AM then please tell 
 us in the comments. Otherwise by signing up you agree to show up at 8 AM b
 y default! Also\, if you’re running late for any reason then please tell
  us in the comments – just make sure you’re not driving at the time an
 d please always drive safely!\n\nCourts are subject to availability and we
 ather. If you make serious plans to attend then please be prepared to canc
 el or adjust our location as needed. Furthermore\, by attending you agree 
 to be fully responsible for your own health and safety. Each person is res
 ponsible for their own decision to take a break\, even if it has to be in 
 the middle of a match! So health first\, fun second\, friendly competition
  third!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314566423/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260430T203224Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260430T203224Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
